sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant R as MessageRouter
  participant I as InterviewHandler
  participant A as AnswerParser
  participant G as Gemini Flash
  participant Q as QuestionBank
  participant S as SessionStore
  U->>R: "the mug and 4 every day"
  R->>I: handle(msg, session)
  I->>A: parse(text, items)
  A->>A: local parse finds 4
  A->>G: resolve "the mug" against item labels (JSON schema)
  G-->>A: itemIds [2]
  A-->>I: usage daily for items 2 and 4
  I->>S: save(session)
  I->>Q: next(session)
  Q-->>I: discard question
  I-->>R: echo line + next question
  R-->>U: "Got it: 2 mug + 4 notebook daily. Anything here that's trash?"
